 "summaries": [
  {
   "section": "Tire",
   "text": "All four tires have an adequate amount of remaining tread depth with some minimal dry rot on the right rear tire. The wheels have light curb rashes."
  },
  {
   "section": "Exterior",
   "text": "The vehicle's exterior was dusty during inspection, which can hide minor imperfections. However, there are still minor miscellaneous scratches around the vehicle. These scratches are normal for the vehicle's mileage, and most of them are too small to see in photos. The front bumper has scratches to the underside. Need to be under the vehicle to see these. The sunroof does not work. Headlights and taillights were clear and free of cracks or other damage. The panel alignments appeared to be normal. The exterior lights were functional and working properly."
  },
  {
   "section": "Interior",
   "text": "There is light wear to the seats. Normal for mileage. The interior trim shows normal wear consistent with age and mileage. The cloth trim on the B-pillar, where the seatbelt is mounted, has heavy wear and is torn. Refer to picture 28. The carpet is dirty, soiled, and shows moderate wear from use. I did not notice any odd smells or signs that the car had been smoked in. There were also no signs of water leaks. The climate control system operated in all modes and blew the desired temperature."
  },
  {
   "section": "Mechanical",
   "text": "The engine bay was clean. All accessible fluids are on level. It did not have any visible active fluid leaks at the time of inspection."
  },
  {
   "section": "Road Test",
   "text": "The vehicle starts up with no issues or unusual sounds. The steering alignment is straight, and engine performance is good. The vehicle shifts through all gears with no issues. The brakes are firm with no pulsations or grinding. I scanned the vehicle's system, and no error codes were found."
  }
 ],
